---
// Back cover — contact, set like the closing page of the report.
---
<section id="contact" class="relative bg-ink text-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="reveal font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-paper/50 uppercase">
      Correspondence
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight md:text-6xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 80ms"
    >
      Write to <em class="font-light">the studio.</em>
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-paper/60" style="--reveal-delay: 140ms">
      For projects, partnerships, or press &mdash; the inbox is read by the founder himself.
      Allow one business day; there is no support team to escalate to.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-10" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">
      <a
        href="mailto:supianidz@octopy.dev?subject=Hello%20Octopy"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-paper/80 pb-2 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight transition-colors hover:border-ledger hover:text-paper md:text-4xl"
      >
        supianidz@octopy.dev
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10 flex items-center gap-4" style="--reveal-delay: 260ms">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/supianidz"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="GitHub"
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-paper/20 text-paper/70 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-paper/60 hover:text-paper"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-github-logo text-2xl"></i>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/supianidz"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="LinkedIn"
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-paper/20 text-paper/70 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-paper/60 hover:text-paper"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-linkedin-logo text-2xl"></i>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/628159826697?text=Hello%20Supian%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="WhatsApp"
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-paper/20 text-paper/70 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-paper/60 hover:text-paper"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-whatsapp-logo text-2xl"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="border-t border-paper/15">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wide text-paper/40 sm:flex-row"
    >
      <span>&copy; 2026 Octopy &middot; Supian M. All rights reserved.</span>
      <span>
        <a href="/notes" class="underline decoration-paper/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-paper">Field notes</a>
        &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; This report was set by hand &middot; No cookies
      </span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>
